"downloading and copying the Qubes ISO onto the installation medium. "
"`Download <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/>`__ a Qubes ISO. The size of "
"each Qubes ISO is available on the `downloads <https://www.qubes-os.org/"
"downloads/>`__ page by hovering over the download button."
msgstr ""

