#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:43
#: 83e0bbada017487eb9bc80ea63027e07
msgid ""
"Any file you download from the internet **could be malicious**, even if it "
"appears to come from a trustworthy source. Our philosophy is to :ref:"
"`distrust the infrastructure <introduction/faq:what does it mean to "
"\"distrust the infrastructure\"?>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:45
#: dca2d02599994a48bb6dc86c37c8377f
