#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:47
#: 09b49b117e044df98601c82205b3ec1b
msgid ""
"**Once the ISO has been verified as authentic**, you should copy it onto the "
"installation medium of your choice, such as a USB drive, dual-layer DVD, or "
"Blu-ray disc. The instructions below assume you’ve chosen a USB drive as "
"your medium. If you’ve chosen a different medium, please adapt the "
"instructions accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:49
#: 71ead5f6dba44fae8d8db3bf1a2841a9
msgid ""
"There are important :doc:`security considerations </user/downloading-"
"installing-upgrading/install-security>` to keep in mind when choosing an "
"installation medium."
msgstr ""

