msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:56
#: f4b555a4d144420dbc643bb9e714cd91
msgid ""
"Be careful to choose the correct device when copying the ISO, or you may "
"lose data. We strongly recommended making a full backup before modifying any "
