"Layout, press the “Plus” symbol, search for “German” as indicated in the "
"screenshot and press “Add”. If you want it be your default language, select "
"the “German” entry in the list and press the arrow button. Click on “Done” "
"in the upper left corner, and you’re ready to go!"
msgstr ""

